schway-screen 1
screen command-palette
title Command palette
description Typing a slash opens the curated built-in order.
variant light-50
size 50x30
cursor 7 27 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  ~/demo


 scripted/scripted-model · scripted API key

 Type a task · Enter sends













  ›   /model          Choose model
      /new            Start a new conversation
      /sessions       Open saved work
      /changes        Review changes
      /undo           Undo the last turn's file…
      /compact        Summarize to free context
